# installer/packages.manifest
#
# Machine-readable dependency list for this personal fork. Source of truth
# is docs/personal-fork/DEPENDENCIES.md (KEEP rows) plus two runtime gaps
# found while debugging the live install (missing `imagemagick`, missing
# `hyq`) - see docs/personal-fork/ARCHITECTURE.md "Runtime initialization"
# for how each was found.
#
# Format (pipe-delimited, '#' comments and blank lines ignored):
#   name | source | reason
#
# source is one of:
#   repo    - official Arch repository, pacman -S --needed <name>
#   aur     - AUR only, requires an AUR helper the installer does not
#             bootstrap; explicit per-package confirmation before touching it
#   source  - no repo/AUR package exists; built from a pinned upstream git
#             source under explicit confirmation, never automatically
#
# packages.sh only ever offers `pacman -S --needed <missing repo packages>`
# as a single confirmed sudo invocation. aur/source entries are reported,
# never auto-installed.

hyprland            | repo   | Compositor (already required by this fork)
aquamarine          | repo   | Hyprland's DRM/EGL backend library
uwsm                | repo   | Session/env manager this fork launches Hyprland through
waybar               | repo   | Status bar
hyprlock             | repo   | Lockscreen
hypridle             | repo   | Idle daemon
hyprpolkitagent       | repo   | Polkit auth agent for GUI privilege prompts
xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland | repo | Screen share / portal backend for Hyprland
xdg-desktop-portal-gtk | repo  | GTK file-picker portal
rofi                 | repo   | Launcher/menu framework used throughout hyde-shell
brightnessctl         | repo   | Backlight control (hypridle listeners)
playerctl             | repo   | Media control (waybar modules)
networkmanager         | repo   | Networking stack
network-manager-applet  | repo   | nm-applet tray icon
bluez                | repo   | Bluetooth stack
bluez-utils            | repo   | bluetoothctl and friends
blueman               | repo   | blueman-applet tray icon
grim                  | repo   | Screenshot capture
slurp                 | repo   | Screenshot region selection
satty                 | repo   | Screenshot annotation
hyprpicker             | repo   | Freeze-frame screen for grimblast's area selection (MOD+CTRL+P); missing on this machine as of this audit
wl-clipboard           | repo   | wl-copy/wl-paste - grimblast's copy/copysave actions hard-require wl-copy; missing on this machine as of this audit
cliphist               | repo   | Single clipboard-history backend for the Hyprland session
wf-recorder            | repo   | Lightweight native Wayland screen recording
rtkit                  | repo   | Realtime scheduling broker used by PipeWire when available
grimblast              | source | hyprwm/contrib - screenshot capture helper every screenshot keybind in Configs/.local/lib/hyde/screenshot.sh execs unconditionally (no existence check); no repo/AUR package, and upstream HyDE's now-deleted Scripts/ used to fetch it as a raw blob at deploy time (flagged in SECURITY.md, never actually resolved in this fork). No compiler needed, plain bash - installer/build-grimblast.sh (pinned commit, asks for confirmation, installs only to ~/.local/lib/hyde/screenshot)
swaync                | repo   | Notification daemon (dunst intentionally not installed - see DEPENDENCIES.md)
sddm                  | repo   | Login manager - hosts the vendored pixel-rainyroom/pixel-cyberpunk Qt6/QML greeter themes (installer/sddm/); replaces greetd as the active display-manager.service. Missing on this machine as of this audit - see ROADMAP.md
weston                 | repo   | SDDM's own documented default Wayland-greeter host compositor (DisplayServer=wayland with no CompositorCommand override, installer/sddm/sddm.conf.d/20-wayland.conf) - see ROADMAP.md for why this was chosen over CompositorCommand=Hyprland/cage
greetd                | repo   | Kept installed, disabled, as the rollback display manager once sddm is switched in (installer/migrate-greetd-to-sddm.sh) - already installed on this machine
greetd-regreet          | repo   | ReGreet greeter for greetd, part of the same rollback path - already installed on this machine
kmscon                | repo   | VT text-mode console renderer; kept installed (unit disabled via installer/fix-vt1-conflict.sh) - already installed on this machine, see ROADMAP.md "VT1 conflict"
wlogout               | aur    | Power/logout menu - the fork's sole accepted AUR dependency
lua                   | repo   | Lua 5.5 runtime Hyprland links against
lua-lgi                | repo   | GObject-Introspection bindings for Lua - KNOWN BROKEN on Lua 5.5, see ARCHITECTURE.md
lua51-lgi              | source | Only needed if you choose the "separate Lua 5.1 runtime for lgi" fix path documented in ARCHITECTURE.md; not installed by default
python                | repo   | Backs ~49 scripts under .local/lib/hyde
power-profiles-daemon    | repo   | Waybar power-profile module backend
imagemagick            | repo   | `magick` binary - REQUIRED by wallbash.sh for palette extraction; missing on this machine as of this audit
jq                     | repo   | JSON handling, used by swaync.sh and others
hyq                    | source | HyDE-Project/hyprquery - .hypr-lang query tool required by theme.switch.sh, color/hypr.sh, waybar.py and wallbash/scripts/swaync.sh; no repo/AUR package found. Upstream is CMake/C++23 (NOT Cargo/Rust, despite earlier notes here) - build with installer/build-hyq.sh, a pinned-commit deterministic builder that installs only to ~/.local/bin
app2unit               | source | Vladimir-csp/app2unit - HARD dependency of Configs/.local/lib/hyde/app.sh (hyde-shell app ...), which every daemon start_up.lua launches goes through (Waybar, wallpaper, hypridle, hyprpolkitagent, config watcher, battery-notify, notifications); no repo/AUR package. Missing it means those all fail SILENTLY (exit 127, no systemd unit ever created) - this is HyDE's actual gray-screen root cause found auditing this fork. Pure POSIX shell, no compiler - installer/build-app2unit.sh (pinned commit, asks for confirmation, installs only to ~/.local/bin)
awww                   | repo   | Default wallpaper backend (hc.config.wallpaper.backend = "awww" in schema/config.toml; handler Configs/.local/lib/hyde/wallpaper.awww.sh hard-calls the `awww`/`awww-daemon` binaries with no fallback) - found missing and undocumented auditing this fork's gray-screen wallpaper failure; in the official `extra` repo
libnotify              | repo   | notify-send, used by several fallback paths
parallel               | repo   | GNU parallel - used by color.set.sh to render wallbash templates
